      LambdaCDM SHMR at fixed M*, d logM_h/dz = -0.10          -0.307      +0.51
      LambdaCDM SHMR at fixed M*, d logM_h/dz = -0.15          -0.461      +0.58
  [PASS] k01-5 THE VERDICT, and it is a null: with the dominant systematic removed the mass-matched KiDS lensing a0(z) separates nothing -- every branch from a flat a0 to a0 ~ cH(z), and the LambdaCDM SHMR band with the OPPOSITE sign, all sit inside 2 sigma.  The z-lever (dz ~ 0.11) is too short   (0.36s; 0.22s; 0.03s; 0.08s; 0.51s; 0.58s)

